<p style="font-family:Times New Roman;font-size:10pt;font-variant:normal;margin:0pt;"><b>Processes and Procedures for Compensation Decisions </b></p>

<p style="font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:10pt;font-variant:normal;margin:0pt;">&#160;</p>

<p style="font-family:Times New Roman;font-size:10pt;font-variant:normal;margin:0pt;text-indent:25pt;">Our compensation committee has the sole authority to determine our Chief Executive Officer&#8217;s compensation and, in its discretion, may award cash bonus payments in addition to the incentive cash payments set forth in the Chief Executive Officer&#8217;s employment agreement. In determining the Chief Executive Officer&#8217;s compensation, our compensation committee has discretion to consider any factors it deems important, including but not limited to our Chief Executive Officer&#8217;s performance and the performance of the Company. In addition, our compensation committee, in consultation with our Chief Executive Officer, reviews and approves all compensation for other officers.</p>

<p style="font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:10pt;font-variant:normal;margin:0pt;">&#160;</p>

